  "text": "Three queues: Q) — RR with time quantum 8 milliseconds Q, — RR time quantum 16 milliseconds 000 Q,-FCFS Scheduling A new job enters queue Q, which is served FCFS » When it gains CPU, job receives 8 milliseconds quantum = 16 + Ifit does not finish in 8 milliseconds, job is moved to queue Q, At Q, job is again served FCFS and receives 16 additional milliseconds » If it still does not complete, it is preempted and moved to queue Q, 만약 00 으로들어간프로세스가안에 AST 끝내지못하면, 01 으로강등된다. 강등된프로세스는 01 에서는 16msS 받는다. 그래도못끝내면 02 로강등되어서천천히작업해라 . - 45 -",
